2. Top-level architecture

Major blocks:

Cognition Fabric Array (CFA):Hardware tiles for sucker→arm→core agent loops (many small cores, local SRAM, message fabric).

Environment Field Engine (EFE):Fixed-function + programmable units for:

scalar/vector fields (chemicals, light, obstacles)

soft-body constraints

simple fluid-like interactions

Telemetry & Event Ledger Unit (TELU):On-die append-only event buffer + lineage counters.

Crypto Vault Engine (CVE):AES/Fernet-class symmetric core + PBKDF2/Argon2 key derivation + secure key fuses.

Host Interface Bridge (HIB):PCIe / custom serial / SPI-like link with strict, filtered register map.

