5. Host interface & command model

Command classes:

CONFIG: load mission profile, environment parameters, runtime limits

RUN: start/stop/pause simulation epochs

STATUS: health, utilization, lineage counts, alert flags

EXPORT: request encrypted ledger segments or summarized metrics

Security posture:

No direct memory-mapped access to internal raw buffers

All exports either:

encrypted blobs, or

pre-aggregated, low-resolution summaries

6. Operating modes

Autonomous Lab Mode:

Chip runs continuous sweeps, logs internally, raises alert flags to host.

Tethered Observatory Mode:

Host streams external telemetry (e.g., telescope data) into EFE; chip fuses it with internal cognition.

Forensic Replay Mode:

Host requests specific encrypted ledger segments → chip decrypts internally → replays for on-die analysis → returns only metrics.

